error[E0041]: cannot store 'K' in interface 'M': only a class can be the concrete type behind an interface value
  --> check_assert_enum_target.bit:19:17
   |
19 |   let (k, ok) = m.(K)
   |                 ^^^^^ an interface value is the receiver's object pointer, so a non-class has nothing to point to (§14.3)
